---
const editorName = 'Doç. Dr. Senai Aksoy';
---

<section
  class="relative isolate overflow-hidden bg-burgundy px-6 py-8 text-white md:py-12"
  aria-labelledby="home-medical-editor-title"
>
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-6 top-0 h-px bg-white/35"></div>
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-px bg-black/15"></div>
  <div
    class="pointer-events-none absolute -right-10 top-1/2 hidden -translate-y-1/2 font-serif text-[8rem] italic leading-none tracking-[-0.08em] text-white/[0.07] lg:block"
    aria-hidden="true"
  >
    not
  </div>

  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-6 md:grid-cols-[0.72fr_1.28fr] md:items-center md:gap-7">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-5">
      <a
        href="/yayin-kurulu/#senai-aksoy"
        class="group relative block h-20 w-20 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-[20px] border border-white/30 bg-white/12 shadow-[0_20px_50px_-32px_rgba(0,0,0,0.55)] focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-white/70 focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-burgundy md:h-28 md:w-28 md:rounded-[22px]"
        aria-label="Doç. Dr. Senai Aksoy yayın kurulu kartı"
      >
        <img
          src="/images/writers/senai-aksoy.webp"
          alt="Doç. Dr. Senai Aksoy"
          width="224"
          height="224"
          loading="eager"
          decoding="async"
          class="h-full w-full object-cover transition duration-500 group-hover:scale-[1.04]"
        />
      </a>
      <div>
        <p class="mb-2 text-[0.65rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.26em] text-white/78">
          Bilimsel Editörün Notu
        </p>
        <h2 id="home-medical-editor-title" class="font-serif text-3xl leading-none tracking-[-0.03em] md:text-5xl">
          {editorName}
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-white/72">
          Estranova Bilimsel Editörü
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="relative border-t border-white/24 pt-6 md:border-l md:border-t-0 md:pl-8 md:pt-0">
      <p class="max-w-3xl font-serif text-xl italic leading-snug text-white md:text-3xl">
        Her belirti büyük bir alarm değildir; ama "boş ver, geçer" denecek kadar önemsiz de olmayabilir.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-base leading-relaxed text-white/80">
        Estranova'da bilimsel editör notu biraz kırmızı kalem, biraz sağduyu, biraz da "bir dakika, bunu gerçekten biliyor muyuz?" sorusudur.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-6 gap-y-3 text-sm font-semibold">
        <a
          href="/hakkimizda/"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-white px-5 py-3 text-burgundy-deep transition hover:bg-cream-soft focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-white/70 focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-burgundy"
        >
          Platform yaklaşımını inceleyin
          <span class="font-serif text-lg" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </a>
        <a
          href="/bilimsel-editor-mektubu/"
          class="text-white underline decoration-white/45 underline-offset-4 transition hover:decoration-white focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-white/70 focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-burgundy"
        >
          Kısa notu okuyun
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
